PE 885: Sorted Digits / 排序数字

=== Sorted-digit numbers ===
Numbers whose digits are in non-decreasing order.
Examples: 1, 2, 3, 11, 12, 13, 22, 111, 112, 123, 999

=== Count by digit length ===
  d= 1: count=         9 (C(9,8)=9)
  d= 2: count=        45 (C(10,8)=45)
  d= 3: count=       165 (C(11,8)=165)
  d= 4: count=       495 (C(12,8)=495)
  d= 5: count=      1287 (C(13,8)=1287)
  d= 6: count=      3003 (C(14,8)=3003)
  d= 7: count=      6435 (C(15,8)=6435)
  d= 8: count=     12870 (C(16,8)=12870)
  d= 9: count=     24310 (C(17,8)=24310)
  d=10: count=     43758 (C(18,8)=43758)

